// The stored form of the two style structs, SPARSE: only what differs
// from the default is written, and what is missing reads as the default.
// The synthesized coding wrote every one of their 85 fields for every
// paragraph and run, and a 126 KB .docx became a 5.8 MB page (37 to 1
// against gzip, and seconds to decode in a tab). Older pages, written
// with every key, decode the same — a present key is simply read.
//
// GENERATED by the script in the commit that added this file from the
// declarations in RichDocument.swift; a field added there must be added
// here, and test/wiki-codec.sh (every corpus document round-tripped
// exactly) is what notices one that was not.

